## Original Content
"Precisamos de reduzir a complexidade, simplificar as nossas estruturas de forma coerente e reduzir os custos", afirmou Oliver Blume durante uma reunião com os trabalhadores na sede do grupo, em Wolfsburg

## Summary
Volkswagen is planning to close factories and risk up to 100,000 jobs as part of a restructuring effort. CEO Oliver Blume emphasized the need to reduce complexity and simplify structures during a meeting with workers in Wolfsburg.

## Key Points
- Volkswagen faces potential closure of factories.
- Approximately 100,000 jobs are at risk.
- CEO Oliver Blume highlighted the need to reduce complexity and simplify structures.
- The company aims to cut costs through restructuring.
- The announcement was made at a meeting with workers at Volkswagen's headquarters in Wolfsburg.


